<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baan raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baan raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Neil Herman raised the rating on Baan Co N.V. to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Expects company to report &quot;gangbuster&quot; fourth quarter results. Says it is likely to beat his revenue estimates, operating margin estimates and earnings estimates &quot;significantly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates likely to rise substantially.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
